@@ -986,6 +986,8 @@ The syntax of containment constraint expression is very simple: using `CONTAINS`
 EHR e CONTAINS COMPOSITION c [openEHR-EHR-COMPOSITION.referral.v1]
 --------
 
+Containment follows the references from an object to the versioned objects it holds: an `EHR` contains the Compositions referred to by its `_compositions_` attribute and the Folders referred to by its `_directory_` and `_folders_` attributes, and a `FOLDER` contains its sub-folders and the versioned objects referred to by its `_items_` attribute. Since a `FOLDER` holds references, one Composition can be contained by several Folders.
+
